n.\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://lensiamedia.com\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Lensia Media\"/><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\"/><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://lensiamedia.com/og-image.jpg\"/><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"Lensia Media\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Lensia Media\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Helping creators grow through strategy, thumbnails and optimization.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://lensiamedia.com/og-image.jpg\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico?favicon.1vris5ty3xwpy.ico\" sizes=\"32x32\" type=\"image/x-icon\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\"/><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"inter_5901b7c6-module__ec5Qua__variable manrope_b7d5735e-module__suUhcW__variable\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><main class=\"min-h-screen bg-[#070B14] text-white\"><section class=\"relative overflow-hidden border-b border-white/10\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0\"><div class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-20 h-80 w-80 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-purple-600/20 blur-[120px]\"></div></div><div class=\"relative mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20\"><a href=\"/\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-400 transition hover:text-white\">← Back to Home</a><div class=\"mt-10 max-w-3xl\"><div class=\"inline-flex rounded-full border border-purple-500/30 bg-purple-500/10 px-4 py-1 text-sm font-medium text-purple-300\">About Lensia Media</div><h1 class=\"mt-6 text-5xl font-extrabold md:text-7xl\">We build creators, not just content.</h1><p class=\"mt-6 text-xl leading-8 text-slate-300\">Lensia Media is a creative growth agency helping creators and brands grow through high-converting thumbnails, editing, YouTube SEO and long-term content strategy.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20\"><div class=\"grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2\"><div><p class=\"text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-purple-400\">Our Story</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 text-4xl font-bold\">Built for the modern creator economy.</h2></div><div class=\"space-y-6 leading-8 text-slate-300\"><p>We founded Lensia Media with one mission: help creators grow through strategy instead of guesswork.</p><p>Every thumbnail, title and editing decision is focused on increasing click-through rate, audience retention and long-term brand value.</p><p>Our goal isn&#x27;t simply producing content—it&#x27;s building recognizable digital brands.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 pb-20\"><div class=\"text-center\"><p class=\"text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-purple-400\">Meet the Founders</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 text-4xl font-bold\">The people behind Lensia Media</h2><p class=\"mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-slate-400\">A creative partnership combining design, strategy and YouTube growth.</p></div><div class=\"mt-14 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5\"><img src=\"/team/founder1.jpg\" alt=\"Founder 1\" class=\"aspect-[4/5] w-full object-cover\"/><div class=\"p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">Your Name</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-purple-400\">Co-Founder • Creative Director</p><p class=\"mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-300\">Leads creative direction, thumbnail design and visual branding for creators and businesses.</p></div></div><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5\"><img src=\"/team/founder2.jpg\" alt=\"Founder 2\" class=\"aspect-[4/5] w-full object-cover\"/><div class=\"p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">Partner Name</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-purple-400\">Co-Founder • Growth Strategist</p><p class=\"mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-300\">Specializes in YouTube SEO, analytics and long-term content growth systems.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 pb-24\"><div class=\"rounded-3xl border border-purple-500/20 bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-600/10 to-indigo-600/10 p-10 text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold\">Ready to grow your channel?</h2><p class=\"mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-slate-300\">Let&#x27;s discuss your goals and build a strategy tailored to your content.</p><a href=\"/#contact\" class=\"mt-8 inline-flex rounded-2xl bg-purple-600 px-8 py-4 font-semibold transition hover:bg-purple-500\">Contact Us</a></div></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3l04zcqx63h3y.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[43467,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0pn1ysv-nlkyk.js\\\"],\\\"LanguageProvider\\\"]\\n3:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0pn1ysv-nlkyk.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0pn1ysv-nlkyk.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n5:I[47257,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0pn1ysv-nlkyk.js\\\"],\\\"ClientPageRoot\\\"]\\n6:I[60078,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0pn1ysv-nlkyk.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/327_nkbsuq9_8.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n9:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0pn1ysv-nlkyk.js\\\"],\\\"OutletBoundary\\\"]\\na:\\\"$Sreact.suspense\\\"\\nd:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0pn1ysv-nlkyk.js\\\"],\\\"ViewportBoundary\\\"]\\nf:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0pn1ysv-nlkyk.js\\\"],\\\"MetadataBoundary\\\"]\\n11:I[68027,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0pn1ysv-nlkyk.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\",1]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1buik8n9itb2j.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/83afe278b6a6bb3c-s.p.2bn3s6zvc0dyp.woff2\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"f